    "title": "Sabalenka eyes Fernandez revenge in US Open third round",
    "text": "Defending US Open champion Aryna Sabalenka says she is \"a better player and person\" than the one who lost to Leylah Fernandez four years ago as they prepare for a re-run of their 2021 semi-final.\nSabalenka overcame a spirited challenge from unseeded Russian Polina Kudermetova to advance to the third round in New York on Wednesday.",
